      "message": "In that case where it should be generated?\n\n- objtree was chosen to support wider use-case in the past: http://aosp/2441882\n\n- debugging inspection was my argument when you asked me to remove it in the past :), but I think it\u0027s mostly for dev purposes and source list is enough to debug unless working on the script when you can temporary disable this.\n\n- Line#118 generates it unconditionally; and it stays in the objtree if prior operation fails even without this removal, and force copy will make sure it is current on the next build.",
